<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">FLMN- OMUSEBEZI NO KUTOLOKA EBIBELE NO SILUYANA</book>
  <para style="h">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi kwa Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIMONI</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebuka no kwibiba ya Filimoni kame ina kun̄oliwa kwa mutumiwa Paulusi (1.1). Paulusi kame ana kun̄ola ebuka eyi yoli mutolngo, okutalusa nji kame ana kwin̄ola luli yoli mu Loma. Nji kame ana kwikalanga mu Loma cwale kame ifanena okun̄oliwa mu myaka makumi atanu ni likumi limweya munyima (60) no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite, mi enako imweya eyo ana kun̄ola ebuka no Makolose.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kame ana kun̄ola ebuka eyi ku mulume oisaniwa Filimoni. Filimoni neli omunjili no Keleke mane nakwikala naabika. Paulusi nakumun̄olela oku mukumbela nji alese okuba ekoto ku mubika waye Onesimasi woyo ona kushotoka kwa Filimoni. Ku mulawo no siloma, Filimoni nakwikala ni tukelo no kuba omubonda Onesimasi. Paulusi kame akutusisa amaywi no kukandimeka Filimoni okutambula Onesimasi kanyi omulumeli mane kame anahana nji Onesimasi apumenwe okusebeza ni Paulusi (1.13-14)</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwa no titaba</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi kame akeeta Filimoni mu (1.1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Cwale Paulusi kame akumbela musibaka sa Onesimasi nji Filimoni amutambule kanyi minaye mu ulumeli (1.4-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi kame amana mu kulimukisa omunahano waye no kupota mi kame atuma okukeeta kwaye (1.22-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa mene Paulusi elipantiti mulibaka lya Kilesite Jesu ni Timoteya omwabetu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Kame tun̄olela kwa wene Filimoni omusingiwa ni mwabetu mu musebezi <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>ni kwa Afiya mandetu ni Akipasi, omwabetu omusole ni keleke mu ndoo yowe.<verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Esishemo siikale nanyi ni kozo itunda kwa Nyambe Sitetu ni kwa Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elilato ni Tumelo ya Filimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Kame ni kutumelanga kwa Nyambe enako yonje aba nimi pulukanga mu titapelo tange. <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>Kakuli kame niyupa eyi no lilato ni tumelo eyo uli nayo kwa Mbumu Jesu ni kwa asikupumena onje a Nyambe. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Kame ni lapela nji okutabela no tumelo yowe ifanene okukulisa ezibo no uwa wetu wonje mwa Kilesite. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Kakuli kame niwabelelwe onene ni kombaombiwa okutunda mu lilato lyowe omwabange. Kakuli emicima no aasikupumena kame ninatende eyi no ubya mwa wene.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo Kumbela Filimoni nji Atambule wino Onesimasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Abo cwale simba nji kame nili ni undume mwa Kilesite kame nitwisa oku milaela okutenda eso mufanena oku tenda. <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>Mulibaka no lilato kame ni singa okukumbela kwa wene mene Paulusi omunume mukulu mi bano nili elipantiti kame mulibaka lya Kilesite Jesu, <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>Kame ni kumbela kwa wene mulibaka lya mwanange Onesimasi woyo inakutenda sitaye abo menili mu tolongo. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Ku matatekelo kasikwikalanga ni tuso kwa wene, kono bano niwautokwa luli kwa wene ni kwa mene.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Kame nimuusa kwa wene, okumutuma yo mucima wange wonje. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Simba nji kame ninakusinga okwikala naye kuno, mulibaka nji ani sebeleze mu sibaka sowe mu nako no kunungiwa kwange mulibaka no liywi no kuwaba. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Kono kame nina kusinga okwatenda esinjili me kawasilimuka oweli. Nji ouwa sotende olese kuutenda mu kukandimekwa kono outende mu kusinga kowe. <verse eid="PHM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Mwendi eli elibaka ana kutundela Onesimasi kwa wene mu nako icana nji cwale wikale naye okuta oku no kwaabwa, <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>cwale kasa kanyi mubika kono okubitelele omubika, omwabetu osingiwa, onene kwa mene, kono cwale ngasibine kwa wene, bamweya mu lutu mane ni mwa Mbumu. <verse eid="PHM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Cwale nji kamo nishimba nji kame nili omukowe mu musebezi, niyonyene omutambule omoso tambwele mene.<verse eid="PHM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Nji kame anaku kufoseze onene simba oku kukolotela esinu sonje, osibalele sitende omubonda wange. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Mene Paulusi kame nin̄ola eyi ni lyoko lyange, mi mbani siteneke. Kulese okwambiwa esinjili ku sikoloti sange mane ni sowe. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Ee mwabange, kame nisinga nji onitendeleko esi mwa Mbumu. Okatuluse omucima wange mwa Kilesite. <verse eid="PHM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Mu kusepa okuyupela kowe kame nikun̄olela muku limuka nji mbutende okubitelela eyi ninaamba.<verse eid="PHM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Ba nako imweya onilukisete omuzuzu, kakuli kame nisepa mu titapelo tenu mba nimiusetwe.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulaano no Mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Epafalasi omwabange lipantiti mwa Kilesite Jesu, kame amikeeta.<verse eid="PHM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Mane ni Maleka, Alisitakasi, Demasi ni Luka akwange ni belekanga noo. <verse eid="PHM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Esishemo sa Mbumu Jesu Kilesite siikale mu myoyo yenu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
